      "created_at": "2020-04-29T18:00:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There was an old Wizard Magazine article where Kurt Busiek talked about heroes wearing Red or Blue fighting villains wearing Green and Purple.<br>\nSuperman and Spiderman being the best examples since so many of both their bad guys use those colors that contrast with the good guys pallet.<br>\nHe also basically did a “writer’s room” to whip up a color contrast villain for Samaritan and while it was a long wait Infidel did get a comic.</p>",
